############ PART 1: kubesec, every Deployment scored separately
The earlier audit piped whole manifests to 'scan /dev/stdin', which reads only the first
YAML document. For 30-services.yaml that meant pricing-fn alone was ever scored.
Here each Deployment is exported from the cluster and scored on its own, so the score
describes what is actually running rather than what a file claims.

  checkout-fn        score=12    rule hits=14
  gateway            score=12    rule hits=14
  inventory-fn       score=12    rule hits=14
  postgres           score=11    rule hits=14
  pricing-fn         score=12    rule hits=14

  Deployments found: 5, scored: 5

